{"hymn":"S345","parent":"E1359","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Que mi vida entera esté","subtitle":"Consagración—Rendirlo todo al Señor","syl":{"n1":"Que","n2":"mi","n3":["vi","i"],"n4":["da‿en","m"],"n5":["te","m"],"n6":["ra‿es","m"],"n7":["té,","t"],"n9":["Con","i"],"n10":["sa","m"],"n11":["gra","m"],"n12":["da‿a","t"],"n13":"Ti,","n14":["Se","i"],"n15":["ñor;","t"],"n17":"Que","n18":"mis","n19":["dí","i"],"n20":["as","t"],"n21":["pue","i"],"n22":["dan","t"],"n23":"ser,","n25":["Pa","i"],"n26":["ra","t"],"n27":"Tu","n28":["glo","i"],"n29":["ria","t"],"n30":["y‿ho","i"],"n31":["nor.","t"],"n33":"En","n34":"la","n35":"cruz","n36":["mo","i"],"n37":["ris","m"],"n38":["te","t"],"n39":"Tú","n40":"por","n41":"mí,","n43":"Y","n44":"Tu","n45":["san","i"],"n46":["gre","t"],"n47":["de","i"],"n48":["rra","m"],"n49":["mas","m"],"n50":["te‿a","m"],"n51":["llí.","t"],"n53":"Mi","n54":["vi","i"],"n55":["da","t"],"n56":["y‿a","i"],"n57":["mor","t"],"n58":["te‿o","i"],"n59":["frez","m"],"n60":["co,","t"],"n61":"mi","n62":["Se","i"],"n63":["ñor,","t"],"n64":["Quie","i"],"n65":["ro","t"],"n66":["con","i"],"n67":["sa","m"],"n68":["grar","m"],"n69":["me‿a","t"],"n70":"Ti."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Ten mis manos y mis pies","Para cosechar la mies;","Ten mis labios para hablar","Por doquiera Tu verdad."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Ten mi plata y oro hoy,","Ni una pizca retendré.","Mi intelecto, úsalo,","Oh Señor, para Tu bien."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Toma aun mi corazón,","Y hazlo Tuyo, mi Señor;","Mi afecto y voluntad","A Tus pies quiero postrar."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Toma mi completo ser","Y uno contigo seré.","Tómame para que así","Sea sólo para ti."]}]}